OL,3,GNEWSAWe survived the Aberfan disaster
OL,4,Aas schoolchildren, but were told to
OL,5,Anever talk about it again
OL,6,
OL,7,FJanett Bickley almost stayed home from
OL,8,Fschool on the morning of 21 October
OL,9,F1966.
OL,11,FThe eight-year-old had recently
OL,12,Frecovered from pneumonia, but she was
OL,13,Fdetermined to go in for the last day
OL,14,Fbefore half-term.
OL,16,FShortly after taking her seat at
OL,17,FPantglas Junior School, Janett was
OL,18,Fburied beneath tonnes of coal slurry
OL,19,Ffrom a collapsing tip. It engulfed the
OL,20,Fclassrooms and killed 144 people,
OL,21,Fincluding 116 children.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
