OL,3,GNEWSAWe survived the Aberfan disaster
OL,4,Aas schoolchildren, but were told to
OL,5,Anever talk about it again
OL,6,
OL,7,FSixty years later, Janett is one of the
OL,8,Fmany survivors of the Aberfan disaster
OL,9,Fwhose lives were shaped by what they
OL,10,Fexperienced.
